                      <description>Change your Regiment Hero&apos;s Move characteristic to 6&quot;, their Health characteristic to 8 and their Control characteristic to 5.
In addition, replace your Regiment Hero&apos;s melee weapon with a **Great Weapon of Renown**.</description>
