                      <description>Replace your Regiment Hero&apos;s **^^Infantry^^** keyword with the **^^Monster^^** keyword.
Change your Regiment Hero&apos;s Move characteristic to 8&quot;, their Health characteristic to 12 and their Control characteristic to 10.
In addition, replace your Regiment Hero&apos;s melee weapon with a **Monstrous Weapon of Renown** and **Massive Punches or Kicks**.</description>
