                        <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"/>
                        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If an enemy unit was destroyed this turn by this unit&apos;s combat attacks, **Heal (5)** this unit. If that enemy unit was a **^^Hero^^**, **Heal (X)** this unit, where **X** is the number of damage points allocated to this unit.</characteristic>
