                        <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an enemy unit in combat with this unit to be the target. Then pick 1 of this unit&apos;s melee weapons to be the **Sacrificial Weapon**.</characteristic>
                        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">For the rest of the turn, add the target&apos;s Control characteristic, to a maximum of 5, to the Attacks characteristic of the **Sacrificial Weapon**, but all of its combat attacks must target that enemy unit.</characteristic>
                        <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
                        <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
