                        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a D3. If there are no enemy units within 9&quot; of this unit, roll a dice instead. On a 2+, this unit can move a number of inches equal to the roll. It can move through the combat ranges of enemy units but cannot end that move in combat.</characteristic>
