                        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If the target is wholly within enemy territory, roll on the Exotic Ingredients table and add the corresponding ingredients to your roster. If the target is not wholly within enemy territory, roll on the Basic Ingredients table instead.</characteristic>
