                        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. On a 3+, the target no longer has that Ghyranite Concoction and give this unit that Ghyranite Concoction. If this unit already has a Ghyranite Concoction, it must immediately use one of those Ghyranite Concotions.</characteristic>
