                        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Pick a Ghyranite Concoction. If you have the ingredients listed in its recipe on your roster, you can immediately mix it. Remove those ingredients from your roster and give that Ghyranite Concoction to your unit.</characteristic>
