                        <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Your Shooting Phase</characteristic>
                        <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a visible enemy unit within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic>
                        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a D3 and apply the corresponding effect:
**1 *Potion of Instant Corrosion:*** Inflict D3 mortal damage on the target.
**2 *Potion of Imprecision:*** Subtract 1 from hit rolls for the target&apos;s attacks for the rest of the turn.
**3 *Potion of Vulnerability:*** Ward rolls cannot be made for the target for the rest of the turn.</characteristic>
                        <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
                        <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
