                    <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Battle, Reaction: You declared a **^^Spell^^** ability from the Lore of the Overgrown Wilds for a unit wholly within 6&quot; of this unit.</characteristic>
