                <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an enemy **^^Hero^^** within 18&quot; of your general and visible to them to be the target.</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">For the rest of the turn, subtract 1 from save rolls and ward rolls for the target.</characteristic>
