                <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a visible enemy unit within 9&quot; of a friendly **^^Hero^^** to be the target.</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice .On a 1-2, for the rest of the turn, subtract 1 form the number of dice rolled when making charge rolls for the target, to a minimum of 1. On a 3+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the roll.</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
                <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
